WEBVTT

00:01.100 --> 00:03.800
<b>Well, she is an aspiring actress.</b>

00:09.010 --> 00:13.500
<b>Dejiko and Puchiko
were selected by auditions.</b>

00:13.620 --> 00:18.250
<b>How was the voice actress
for Rabi-en-Rose selected?</b>

00:18.750 --> 00:24.450
<b>When we held auditions
for Dejiko and Puchiko,</b>

00:24.560 --> 00:27.820
<b>the MC was Kyoko Hikami.</b>

00:27.930 --> 00:29.790
<b>And even before that,</b>

00:29.900 --> 00:33.200
<b>Broccoli has worked with Hikami-san
on several occasions.</b>

00:33.300 --> 00:37.140
<b>From her voice type and
after discussing it with Koge-Donbo,</b>

00:37.570 --> 00:40.130
<b>we thought she'd be perfect,</b>

00:40.240 --> 00:43.800
<b>so we requested her
specifically for the role.</b>

00:48.320 --> 00:52.950
<b>We thought she sounded like
a feisty older sister.</b>

00:53.050 --> 00:56.580
<b>She was a perfect match
for the character.</b>

00:59.660 --> 01:01.190
<b>That thought was-</b>

01:01.300 --> 01:04.270
<b>That was our original plan, yes.</b>

01:08.970 --> 01:12.460
<b>Gema knows a lot
for just arriving on Earth.</b>

01:12.570 --> 01:18.480
<b>In fact, everyone is really
knowledgeable about the otaku culture.</b>

01:29.260 --> 01:31.750
<b>He appears from behind the wall too.</b>

01:31.860 --> 01:33.850
<b>Piyoko appears like that too,
doesn't she?</b>

01:33.960 --> 01:35.550
<b>From behind a wall?</b>

01:35.660 --> 01:37.130
<b>Yes.</b>

01:37.230 --> 01:38.790
<b>You remember a lot!</b>

01:38.900 --> 01:46.600
<b>Note: Rod-yan appears in
the Di Gi Charat Summer Special 2002.</b>

01:38.900 --> 01:41.400
<b>I think Rod-yan does too.</b>

01:41.400 --> 01:43.870
<b>I think so.</b>

01:43.870 --> 01:46.600
<b>So I think Piyoko did too.</b>

01:47.610 --> 01:50.740
<b>In one of the episodes.</b>

02:14.340 --> 02:17.530
<b>None of the characters
are making any sense now.</b>

02:17.640 --> 02:20.570
<b>What are they influenced by?</b>

02:23.510 --> 02:25.380
<b>''It's yellow!''</b>

02:28.250 --> 02:32.150
<b>We didn't have any characteristic
for Gema like this at all.</b>

02:32.250 --> 02:35.050
<b>So this is an original characteristic
for the anime series.</b>

02:35.160 --> 02:39.490
<b>But after this it became common
knowledge that Gema was like this.</b>

02:40.360 --> 02:42.630
<b>He does look like
he can soak up water, though.</b>

02:42.730 --> 02:46.960
<b>We thought,
''Oh, he is like a sponge.''</b>

02:50.770 --> 02:53.830
<b>After this,
in anything anyone draws,</b>

02:53.940 --> 02:58.970
<b>if Gema takes in water
he swells up.</b>

02:59.080 --> 03:02.170
<b>So this anime is the original joke.</b>

03:12.460 --> 03:14.860
<b>It's not a beautiful scene, is it?</b>

03:14.960 --> 03:16.520
<b>And it lasts a long time.</b>
